WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
MIZUHO-FX: There is a rumor circulating about possible JPY intervention if we break through the next level.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Hugo: We heard the same chatter, hard to tell how credible it is at this stage.

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
MIZUHO-FX: Agreed, no official comment yet, but the market is clearly pricing in some risk of it.

4
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Hugo: Are you seeing any unusual flow that would support the rumor being real?

5
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
MIZUHO-FX: Nothing definitive, though volumes have picked up meaningfully in the last half hour.

6
00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Hugo: We will keep size conservative near that level just in case, not worth the risk otherwise.

7
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:20.000
MIZUHO-FX: That is probably wise, these headlines can move the pair very quickly if it turns out true.

8
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:40.000
Hugo: Appreciate the heads up, will keep an eye on it through the rest of the session.

9
00:02:40.000 --> 00:03:00.000
MIZUHO-FX: Will do the same, talk if anything develops.
